OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'cruel' attack that
OL,4,Akilled pensioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 15 years for
OL,7,Fkilling a pensioner in a "cruel,
OL,8,Fcallous and calculated attack" after
OL,9,Fforcing his way into the his home to
OL,10,Fdemand drugs.
OL,12,FWayne Milsom, 51, of Keynsham,
OL,13,FSomerset, was cleared of Stephen
OL,14,FRidgeway's murder last summer but was
OL,15,Fretried for manslaughter and found
OL,16,Fguilty at Bristol Crown Court in July.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
