OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 'cruel' attack that
OL,4,Akilled pensioner
OL,5,
OL,6,FRidgeway, 72, told police two men broke
OL,7,Finto his home on 3 November 2024,
OL,8,Fthreatened him with a knife, hit him on
OL,9,Fthe head with a hammer and kicked him
OL,10,Fwhile on the floor. He died a month
OL,11,Flater in hospital.
OL,13,FDuring sentencing earlier at Bristol
OL,14,FCrown Court, Judge Lambert said Milsom
OL,15,Fhad an "appalling record for violence"
OL,16,Fand posed a future risk to the public.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
